    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (4) : Heparin\n\n(1) Heparin induced thromboytopenia\n\n(2) Hypoaldosteronism\n\n(3) Osteoporosis\n\n(4) Type IV RTA\n\n(Type 4 renal tubular acidosis)\n\n[Image: 05a998a2de8e8337f369baaf7fcf4cbc36a8d0101357b1b9fc97c153382f9eb2]\n\n[Image: 9a425fc6585fd53820cfce37ea7f3232722449f579b846b670ca7e510eda3b05]\n\n[Image: 22ddbca9125ff1bec5c5c5815fb33ef18654fa5b0a950259b3111d3c1932571d]\n\n[Image: 5b4dac9b81f8eea98563a1604d073cafc0dc28fc4bffed22547d9f5545039949]\n\n1.1 - Heparin, LMWH, fondaparinux, direct thrombin inhibitors, Xa inhibitors\n[Image: 277d6dd93c909a56ac4e048c44946e2dc9d1d89ef7a2e08080907883effa15d2]\n\n[Image: d624a8546655626b1e42c79e187169ee90ebf7b99d981f03e5e2edc92694e8e3]\n\n[Image: 5d42a451f5c6a755eb006684c27a5cc45128caabaa215f87f7db276b2cd69879]\n\n[Image: 1bb3d14dc3c487ed27252bc52651a1ed2c6900dc98a4091f4176866ee6ecb743]\n\n[Image: 92987436a5377d1532749c2f3493cb39490738e8019a390ae9188e6795476d2f]",
